2026-07-27T11:15:10.0097685Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:15:10.0098202Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:15:10.0099048Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:15:10.0100284Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:15:10.0101923Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
